mt7981b-glinet-gl-mt3000.dts

Source: ImmortalWrt (openwrt24 branch) mt7981b-glinet-gl-mt3000.dts
Adapted for monw/padavan-arm by GitHub Copilot Chat Assistant.

Notes:
- This DTS is placed under trunk/linux-5.15.167/arm64/boot/dts/mediatek/ to match the kernel's DTS layout in this repository.
- SPI-NAND partitions, console (115200), LEDs, Ethernet and WiFi nodes retained from the source.
- Build-system integration (device Makefile/targets) was added separately under the mt3000 branch to allow recognition by the build scripts.

Please run a full local build and report any kernel DTS or driver errors; I'll iterate on fixes if needed.
